   "source": [
    "# 08 - Final Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook combines the results of the four experiments performed in\n",
    "Practical Application 1:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. All valid features.\n",
    "2. Univariate filter feature selection.\n",
    "3. Multivariate filter feature selection.\n",
    "4. Wrapper feature selection.\n",
    "\n",
    "The objective is to compare predictive performance, analyse the effect of\n",
    "feature selection, identify consistently selected employee characteristics,\n",
    "and generate the final tables and figures used in the scientific report."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "a3249844",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
